<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese unemployment fell to 6.5 pct in Q2.</title>
<headline>Portuguese unemployment fell to 6.5 pct in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Portugal fell to 6.5 percent in the second quarter, compared with 7.3 percent in the first quarter, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					Q2 1997   Q1 1997   Q2 1996</p>
<p> Registered unemployed	  299,900   336,500   331,000</p>
<p> Percentage unemployed	  6.5	 7.3	 7.2</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
